9684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder","html_url":"https://github.com/daveTheOldCoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T20:19:15Z","updated_at":"2024-11-02T20:02:49Z","body":"I'm reopening this issue because I've reproduced the problem with the trivial project I mentioned above.\r\n\r\nThe problem appears to occur in alternate openings of the editor. In any case, it occurs intermittently.\r\n\r\nIf I run the project manager from the command line with the -d and -v options, this is output when the plugin is detected:\r\n```\r\nFound a repository at /home/dave/Documents/Godot/Projects/4.4/4.4-mono-test1/.git/.\r\nSelected repository path: /home/dave/Documents/Godot/Projects/4.4/4.4-mono-test1/.git/.\r\n```\r\nand this is output when it fails:\r\n```\r\nERROR: Cannot get class 'GitPlugin'.\r\n   at: _instantiate_internal (core/object/class_db.cpp:550)\r\nERROR: Received a nullptr VCS extension instance during construction.\r\n   at: _load_plugin (editor/plugins/version_control_editor_plugin.cpp:149)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'm attaching the MRP. I omitted the .git, .godot and addons/godot-git-plugin directories from the .zip.\r\n\r\nTo reproduce:\r\n1. Create the project directory with the .zip contents.\r\n2. Use the `git init` command to set up git for the directory.\r\n3. Import the project with the Godot 4.4-dev3 or Godot 4.4-dev3-mono project manager.\r\n4. Add Godot Git Plugin 3.1.1. https://github.com/godotengine/godot-git-plugin/releases/tag/v3.1.1\r\n5. Try opening the project in the editor and observe whether the Commit tab is present, and whether there are errors in the Output pane. Repeat this several times.\r\n\r\n[4.4-mono-test1.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17562573/4.4-mono-test1.zip)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445250439/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445434531","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98643#issuecomment-2445434531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98643","id":2445434531,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rwl6j","user":{"login":"daveTheOldCoder","id":55119684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTE5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55119684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder","html_url":"https://github.com/daveTheOldCoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/events{/privacy}","received